\pard\fi-450\li450\qj\ri0\sb0\sa120\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 033v-034r}}\plain \f0\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5209/"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Nikolaus von Amsdorff: Brief an Georg R\u246 \'f6rer \u252 \'fcber einen p\u228 \'e4pstlichen Legaten, fragt nach Neuigkeiten in Wittenberg: >Tres Epistolae D. Nicolai Amsdorffii ad Georgium Rorarium<}}\plain \f0\fs24  Magdeburg, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5060[0].5064/"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 1535.11.16}}\plain \f0\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Doctiss. Theologo. d. Magistro Gerogio R. Ministro Christi in Euangelio dei Wittemberge, amico et fratri Chariss. S. Ima tandem post longam obliuionem, me nemi tui mi Georgi in Christo frater charissime. Georgius maior libens ... \endash }}\plain \f0\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5686/"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 ... Deus vos custodiat, confirmet et confortet. Amen. Principem nostrum iam prope diem rediturum speramus, maxime mihi hoc iter principis displicuit. Deus bene fortunet factum. Vale in Christo. Magdeburge XVI. Novembris 1535. Tuus Nicolaus Amsdorffius.}}\plain \f0\fs26  }

