'fcgel hochgereckt, kleine Ausf\u252 \'fchrung; (Bl. 399-408) Heraldischer Adler ohne Beizeichen, zweikonturige F\u228 \'e4nge, Fl\u252 \'fcgel nicht vom K\u246 \'f6rper abgegrenzt, Fl\u252 \'fcgel hochgereckt - Lagen: (vorderer Spiele + 1)\plain \f0\super\fs40 1\plain \f0\fs24  + IV\plain \f0\super\fs40 9\plain \f0\fs24  + 3 V\plain \f0\super\fs40 39\plain \f0\fs24  + 3 IV\plain \f0\super\fs40 63\plain \f0\fs24  + III\plain \f0\super\fs40 69\plain \f0\fs24  + 7 IV\plain \f0\super\fs40 125\plain \f0\fs24  + II\plain \f0\super\fs40 129\plain \f0\fs24  + IV\plain \f0\super\fs40 137\plain \f0\fs24  + 2 VI\plain \f0\super\fs40 161\plain \f0\fs24  + 4 IV\plain \f0\super\fs40 193\plain \f0\fs24  + 7 II\plain \f0\super\fs40 221\plain \f0\fs24  + III\plain \f0\super\fs40 227\plain \f0\fs24  + 2 IV\plain \f0\super\fs40 243\plain \f0\fs24  + III\plain \f0\super\fs40 249\plain \f0\fs24  + 3 II\plain \f0\super\fs40 261\plain \f0\fs24  + 2 III\plain \f0\super\fs40 273\plain \f0\fs24  + (III - 1)\plain \f0\super\fs40 278\plain \f0\fs24  + 2 II\plain \f0\super\fs40 286\plain \f0\fs24  + I\plain \f0\super\fs40 288\plain \f0\fs24  + III\plain \f0\super\fs40 294\plain \f0\fs24  + 3 II\plain \f0\super\fs40 306\plain \f0\fs24  + IV\plain \f0\super\fs40 314\plain \f0\fs24  + II\plain \f0\super\fs40 318\plain \f0\fs24  + 2 IV\plain \f0\super\fs40 334\plain \f0\fs24  + 2 VI\plain \f0\super\fs40 358\plain \f0\fs24  + I\plain \f0\super\fs40 360\plain \f0\fs24  + II\plain \f0\super\fs40 364\plain \f0\fs24  + I\plain \f0\super\fs40 366\plain \f0\fs24  + II\plain \f0\super\fs40 370\plain \f0\fs24  + 3 II\plain \f0\super\fs40 382\plain \f0\fs24  + I\plain \f0\super\fs40 384\plain \f0\fs24  + II\plain \f0\super\fs40 388\plain \f0\fs24  + 2 II\plain \f0\super\fs40 396\plain \f0\fs24  + I\plain \f0\super\fs40 398\plain \f0\fs24  + V\plain \f0\super\fs40 408\plain \f0\fs24  + VI\plain \f0\super\fs40 420\plain \f0\fs24  + (1 + hinterer Spiegel)\plain \f0\super\fs40 422\plain \f0\fs24  - g\u252 \'fcl